aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.19) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hydrogen line: a receiver with a narrow flat band, such as an Airspy at 2.5 MSPS,
    gave no calibrated plot. The line window now narrows to fit the band.
  * A scan that cannot be measured says why in the log.

